---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear()
---

<footer class="w-full border-t border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/50 text-base-content">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-8">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand Info -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-primary-content">
            <Icon name="ion:flash" class="h-4 w-4" />
          </div>
          <span class="text-lg font-bold">Swift (AlpineJS Template)</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 max-w-md leading-relaxed">
          极简现代化的全栈静态与轻交互脚手架。秉承「简单的保持简单，复杂的合理拆分」设计哲学，享受极致性能与极速开发体验。
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2">
          <span class="badge badge-sm badge-neutral">Astro 5</span>
          <span class="badge badge-sm badge-neutral">Alpine.js 3</span>
          <span class="badge badge-sm badge-neutral">Tailwind CSS v4</span>
          <span class="badge badge-sm badge-neutral">daisyUI 5</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Navigation Links -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-base-content/90">页面导航</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-base-content/70">
          <li>
            <a href="/" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">
              首页概览
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/#features" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">
              核心特性
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/#interactive-demo" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">
              交互示例
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/#quick-start" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">
              快速上手
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/about" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">
              关于模版
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Ecosystem & Links -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-base-content/90">
          生态与文档
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-base-content/70">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/Pony-Unicorn/alpinejs-template"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-primary transition-colors"
            >
              <Icon name="ion:logo-github" class="h-4 w-4" />
              GitHub 仓库
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://astro.build"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-primary transition-colors"
            >
              Astro 官方文档
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://alpinejs.dev"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-primary transition-colors"
            >
              Alpine.js 官方指南
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://daisyui.com"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-primary transition-colors"
            >
              daisyUI 组件库
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Divider & Bottom Bar -->
    <div class="border-t border-base-content/10 pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-base-content/60">
      <p>© {currentYear} Pony-Unicorn / Swift Template. MIT License.</p>
      <p class="flex items-center gap-1">
        Built with <Icon name="ion:heart" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-error inline" /> Astro + Alpine.js
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
